# Build inputs are LF on every checkout platform. With core.autocrlf=true a
# CRLF checkout changes the bytes that Vite and esbuild read, so a rebuild would
# no longer match the committed dist/. The binary guard keeps any binary asset
# out of line-ending conversion.
* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
